    "localization": {
      "en": {
        "1551e64cf5031a1fe926d9bf": "So, how did it go with the smugglers? You didn't forget about my transport?",
        "183d6d862adea67db133924f": "So, how did it go with the smugglers? You didn't forget about my transport?",
        "94b57bbc925722b7c2886b59": "Of course I didn't! I'll tell you everything... Ugh... You got anything for a hangover?",
